recommend keep-going — AMUS7 (gossip) is GREEN and sends as its own signed round; the pure-local Constel stack now carries point-to-point routing AND one-to-many broadcast (name · roster · handshake · wire · exchange · channel · switchboard · gossip). The socket rung stays Keaton's hand; a Constel consensus/quorum rung over gossip, or a fresh Season A/D/F journey, remain agent-doable, so the loop continues. Clock note: America/New_York read 20260814.050801, earlier than the prior newest 081400; the one-clock monotonic law honored by stamping 081900, just after the work it follows.
